.TH "SKOGAI RUNNER-JOURNAL-HARVEST" 1  "skogai runner-journal-harvest 0.0.0" 
.SH NAME
skogai runner\-journal\-harvest \- agents pick decisions, docs, todos and learnings out of a journal
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBskogai runner journal harvest\fR [OPTIONS] [FILE]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.br
agents pick decisions, docs, todos and learnings out of a journal
.br

.br
the journal is cut into chunks of \-\-turns turns, each chunk goes to one
.br
worker with schema `harvest`. stdout is one json array of every item.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-last\fR=\fIN\fR
.br
only the last N turns
.TP
\fB\-\-turns\fR=\fIN\fR
.br
turns per chunk, default 20
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-model\fR=\fIMODEL\fR
.br
model, default runner.model
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
.br
Print help
.TP
[\fIFILE\fR]
.br
journal, default runner.journal
